  "prefLabel": "Liq 705.06 Wine Manufacturer's License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 705.06 Wine Manufacturer's License. Applicants for a wine manufacturer’s license shall complete and submit Form LTW-30, “License Type Worksheet-Wine Manufacturer – Off Premises Sampling/Retail Sales” (revised 8/2020) providing all required information, acknowledgments, and, for an off-premises sampling retail event, attach a copy of the authorization letter from the nano-brewery allowing the applicant permission to conduct sales and sampling.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Liq 700) #13114, eff 9-25-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/liq100-1100.html"
